.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH g-notes-clear 1  "g-notes-clear " 
.SH NAME
g\-notes\-clear \- Delete all notes for a given file (or every note when no path is given). Requires `\-\-force` to actually run — protects against fat\-finger typos
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBg\-notes\-clear\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete all notes for a given file (or every note when no path is given). Requires `\-\-force` to actually run — protects against fat\-finger typos
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Skip the confirmation prompt
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR]
Restrict to this repo\-relative file path (optional)
